---
import SoundscapePlayer from '../components/SoundscapePlayer.svelte';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="声音空间" description="由浏览器本地生成的三种原创声音场景" hidePageBanner>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-5xl gap-6">
    <SoundscapePlayer client:load />

    <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
      <section class="border-4 border-amber-600 bg-amber-50 p-5 shadow-[6px_6px_0_0_#d97706] dark:bg-amber-950/30 sm:p-6">
        <p class="text-xs font-black tracking-[0.16em] text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-200">HOW IT WORKS</p>
        <h2 class="mt-1 text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">它如何发出声音</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 font-bold leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">点击开始后，浏览器使用 Web Audio 生成低频长音与简短音点；旋律参数随页面代码一起发布，没有远程播放器、音频热链或版权不明的素材。</p>
      </section>
      <section class="border-4 border-emerald-700 bg-emerald-50 p-5 shadow-[6px_6px_0_0_#047857] dark:bg-emerald-950/30 sm:p-6">
        <p class="text-xs font-black tracking-[0.16em] text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-200">DATA BOUNDARY</p>
        <h2 class="mt-1 text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">只存在于当前页面</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 font-bold leading-7 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200">切换场景和调节音量都不会发送网络请求，也不写入本地存储。离开页面时声音引擎会停止，本站不记录你播放了什么或播放了多久。</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
